.TH DOME-PREVIEW 1 "2026-10-20" "de-xr" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dome\-preview \- run the DomeD layout laboratory
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
dome\-preview
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Serve an interactive layout laboratory with synthetic windows on http://127.0.0.1:49640. No headset or running compositor is required. Geometry edits are session\-local; export a JSON profile to reuse them.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
DOME_PREVIEW_PORT overrides port 49640. DOME_CONFIG selects an exported geometry JSON profile.
.SH EXAMPLES
DOME_PREVIEW_PORT=49641 dome\-preview
.SH SEE ALSO
dome\-compositor(1), dome\-xr(1)
